# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Drawn velocities and typed restraints in the Python model on the CPU
# (D198), scenario mixed-npt of Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py.
# NPT runs with drawn velocities and restraints against `mdir run` of the
# same control file in mixed precision.
# The bound takes the NVT runs of `mdir run` in mixed and double precision,
# references only (scenarios mixed-nvt and nvt-double compare the model with
# them).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir mdir-model-test %t mixed-npt | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NPT Mixed; positions
# CHECK: velocities and restraints mixed-npt passed
